WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Tap the iPhone link, and open it in Safari.

00:05.000 --> 00:13.000
Tap the three dots, then Share.
Some Safari layouts show Share directly.

00:13.000 --> 00:19.000
Scroll down and choose Add to Home Screen.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Keep Open as Web App switched on, then tap Add.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.000
Orbit is now on your Home Screen.
Tap the icon to open it.
